  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Treatment of Endometriosis support to Sumaya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UYSTO is fundraising for one Sumaya, our trainee single mother who has been diagnosed with Endometriosis condition. The treatment is expensive for her, she needs feeding while on the medication and she has a burden of debts on her as she has been borrowing to purchase drugs. UYSTO is financially helping her but still the support is not enough as she needs to take the treatment until August 2023 and yet has no other support from anyone.</narrative>
  </description>
